age","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"とりあえず、Hasu さんのやりたいことが「ブラウザで動くポモドーロタイマー」なのであれば、サーバー側での厳密なタイマー管理（アクセスしている人のすべてが同じ時刻で動作して、改竄もできないみたいなやつ）をする必要なくて、ブラウザローカルのタイマーを動かせばいいから、Next.js使うのであれば、SSRする必要もなく、CRS（クライアントサイドレンダリング）すれば、サーバー側で〜みたいな難しいこと考えずに、シンプルに web audio api 使えば実装可能って感じですね。","ts":"1629767834.133100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yJm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2841c75-5620-4450-af19-6ef923dc55d2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"それが一番シンプルですね","ts":"1629767634.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q=j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b1146f9-2fd0-49cb-8f1f-cc1f61f0a1a9","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"めっちゃ適当にやるなら、音を再生したいタイミングで\n```new Audio(\"/path/to/mp3\").play();```\nで良さそう。","ts":"1629767520.129600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gLX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"730df436-f953-41bc-967f-a1bed922e039","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですよね。多分そうかと。\n最終的にはクライアント側のjsで処理することになる（簡単な実装だと）のでサーバー側でどうやってページを生成するかは関係ないですー","ts":"1629765976.126200","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1629765991.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6+r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2a25c17-ae68-4a46-b3d7-89b3e1ce95ed","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"next.jsである必要性がわからなくなってきたw","ts":"1629765781.125000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+jJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d760a6b1-6055-4950-8660-c373d43703dc","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これを書き直しているところです\n\u003chttps://github.com/hashue/Timer\u003e","ts":"1629765647.124300","thread_ts":"1629765138.120200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"hashue/Timer","id":1,"title":"hashue/Timer","text":"Promode timer ","fields":[{"title":"L