":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a01992f6-44c9-421d-bf59-1347ff9e863c","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"わかる。そろそろOASの限界を感じてきましたね。GraphQLが完全な代替になるわけではないし、今後どうなっていくんだろう。","ts":"1629732983.084700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SY2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3da032b0-ffc6-4ab4-b5b9-79b4344d5931","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"自分は今サーバー側で自動生成させてるから、間違ってる == api が間違ってるだから、まだ検知しやすいですかねー。いずれ自動生成が破綻する未来が来るけど、まだ頑張れてますw","ts":"1629732535.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D3bU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d70ff57-64d1-469b-941e-e1bfb1205095","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あーなるほどー。","ts":"1629732332.080300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V=Ceq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e17a61a-e1d3-4306-893a-456063bf03f4","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"マイグレーションプロジェクトなので、既存APIから書き起されたOASが間違っている可能性が大なんですよね〜","ts":"1629732310.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LbM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d7bfb6a-faec-4a80-bb1e-e3a3d84f524c","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"検知なーそこまではできてないなー(掛けるコスト的に)。","ts":"1629732246.079000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3PQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba85e2c0-f221-47e5-a966-8e187ea79230","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"なるほどー。","ts":"1629732051.077800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xoBM/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B87A2200-F8D9-4AB8-A2FF-7A806E174D17","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"やはり一周回って独自実装になりそうですw\nOASありきのプロジェクトなので、OASが生成するコードが変わった時にテストコードで検知したいんですよね。なので、テストコードの書きやすさがとても大事なのです。","ts":"1629731921.077600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4qY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fb82a3f-e23f-4799-a9e8-80943c626f28","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"それが気に入らない点でもありますねー。renderHook の第二引数にいちいちダミーの Provider 設定するのだるい。まぁ swr も場合によってはおんなじこと必要ですけどw","ts":"1629731751.074800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h0gf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c61e630e-d791-496a-9659-ea3f3548a3fd","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ですね","ts":"1629765597.123600","thread_ts":"1629765138.120200","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WFmp"}]}]
